			     GLOBAL RISK MANAGEMENT OPERATIONS
						    PRESENTS

			   THE NEW EXECUTIVE REPORTS VIEWER

					         http://erv.corp.enron.com

The Global Risk Management Operations group has redesigned the Executive Reports Viewer website to be more efficient and robust enough to accomodate the growing number of reports and users utilizing the viewer.  

The Viewer's new functionality includes:

-An easier to view home page with all reports grouped by Business Unit 
-Enhanced security features allowing publisher's to assign security to sections of a report
-Capability of directly emailing the publisher of a report with any questions
-Improved ability to access reports using links and a calendar function
-Comprehensive list of publishers for all reports
-Email notification to viewers when reports are published
-Business links connecting you to industry websites for additional market information
-Report history up to one year, opposed to the former 30 day limit


The old website will close down on July 23rd.  Reports will be published to both sites until then.

Please contact Chris Abel, x33102, Anita Luong, x36753 or Shona Wilson, x39123, with any questions.

If you would like a personal walk thru, please contact Pamela Sonnier, at x37531.

