Subject: Doorstep Review Process
Cc: mike.jordan@enron.com, fernley.dyson@enron.com, ted.murphy@enron.com
Mime-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
