To: Cindy Skinner/HOU/ECT@ECT, Brad McSherry/HOU/ECT@ECT, Norma 
Villarreal/HOU/ECT@ECT, Kimberly Rizzi/HOU/ECT@ECT, Fran L Mayes/HOU/ECT@ECT, 
Gary Buck/HOU/ECT@ECT, Robert Jones/Corp/Enron@ENRON, Sheila 
