	gracie.presas@enron.com, janice.riedel@enron.com
X-From: Susan Runkel
X-To: Sheila Glover, Brent A Price, Leslie Reeves, Stephen P Schwarz
X-cc: Gary Buck, Norma Villarreal, Sally Beck, Gracie S Presas, Janice Riedel
X-bcc: 
