cover might reduce attendance and wanted to keep the speaker series free for 
attendees. A $10 cover wouldn't cover all of the expenses anyway and we felt 
it would create a bad impression. Deed Vest of Rockwell International has 
confirmed availability for the date. Carolyn is handling the set up.

September 20th Houston's Economy Panel
Paul Murphy, Southwest Bank of Texas: confirmed with sponsorship
