Texas-New Mexico Power Company and SW Acquisition, L.P., EC99-92-000, 
ES99-47-000 -- On July 9th, TNMP, on behalf of itself and its holding 
company, TNP Enterprises, together with SW Acquisition, on behalf of itself 
and its subsidiary, ST Acquisition Corp., filed a joint Section 203 
application to dispose of the jurisdicitional facilities of TNMP to SW 
Acquisition.  The joint application was filed pursuant to an agreement and 
plan of merger between TNP and SW Acquisition.  TNMP also filed a Section 204 
request for Commission authorization to issue securities and/or assume 
liabilities.

