Mark, 

Per my telephone conversation with Margaret Gerhardt, I want to thank you 
very much for your interest in participating on the e-commerce panel for the 
Energy Bar Association mid-year program.? Margaret suggested that you be 
listed on the program brochure as "invited," in case a conflict should arise. 
